msgid "Which messaging services a handle can be on — Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema — and what a handle on each one looks like. A handle on none of them is listed as “Other”. Nothing here is ever looked up online."
msgstr "Helduleku bat zein mezularitza-zerbitzutan egon daitekeen: Matrix, XMPP, Seinalea, Telegrama, Hiruma, eta zein helduleku ematen zaion bakoitzari. Haietako bat ere ez da \"bestelakoa\" esaten. Hemen ez dago ezer linean."
